tcc 0.9.27 for OS/2 Warp ARM64 (aarch64, musl, static programs):
- arm64-link.c: programs link at 0x60000000 (the kernel's user window);
  the relocations clang emits in musl's libc.a (LDST8/16/32/64/128_ABS_LO12_NC,
  CONDBR19, TSTBR14); in a static program the GOT entries get the final
  addresses (no dynamic linker fills them).
- libtcc.c, tccelf.c (CONFIG_TCC_OS2WARP): static by default; libc again
  after libtcc1.a.
- tcc.h: building the cross compiler on an Apple (aarch64) Mac: not
  "native" (no -run, whose backtrace needs Linux's ucontext).

